:: paint.failToStart [unfinished]
{=

(storylet: when
    ($funcEventOutput: "paintFail") is not false
)

(metadata:
    "title", "Hesitation...",
    "devNote", [Write.],
)


<!--the mainDone choices will be available after the first visit, whereupon this passage's name is added to $story's lock-->
(set: _showDoneChoicesAtBeginning to false)
(if: $story's lock contains "paint.failToStart")[(set: _showDoneChoicesAtBeginning to true)]


($funcMainContent:
[{<!--?mainReading-->

The veil - so ethereal as to not exist - is leaden to your hands. ($funcReveal: "Thoughts of failure", "thoughts1") weight heavy in the pit of your stomach.

|thoughts1)[
<br>
With fingers so frail and heart so weak, ($funcReveal: "how could you ever hope", "thoughts2") to pick up a brush?]
|thoughts2)[` `What is an artist ($funcReveal: "who does not make art?", "thoughts3")]
|thoughts3)[` `($funcReveal: "What are you", "thoughts4") if not an artist?]
|thoughts4)[` `Perhaps you are ($funcReveal: "//nothing//.", "thoughts5")]
|thoughts5)[` `If so, then what good is this body, this flesh?
(t8n: "dissolve")(show:?tomorrow)
(t8n: "dissolve")(show:?mainDone)
]

|tomorrow)[
<br>
No, you yet live. Tomorrow, you will be readier.
<br>
$cssDesc[There is always a "later" with you, isn't there?]]

}],
[{<!--?mainDone-->

<!--reveal an extra paragraph if you've already read everything-->
(if: $story's lock contains "paint.failToStart")[(show: ?tomorrow)]

<!--choices-->
<ol>

<li>($funcDummyLink: "Lift up the veil.", "Another day. Always another.")</li>

<li>($funcBackLink: "Leave it be for now.", "At least you still have the rest of your " + (str: (passage: "code.timePass")'s timeFullNames's ($time's timeOfDay)) + ".", [{
    <!--temporary lock; start the "paintFail" event-->
    ($funcEventStart: "paintFail")
    <!--lock this passage (read)-->
    ($funcLock: "paint.failToStart")
}])</li>

</ol>

}],

_showDoneChoicesAtBeginning
)